From：Mridu Mousam Neog</p><video controls="" poster="https://oss-xpc0.xpccdn.com/uploadfile/article/2026/3/30/f807fd20759056b2ca39e0334b9f64e4"><source src="https://us-xpc5-l2.xpccdn.com/b40309ed-a949-4c73-abc1-c8d25ab87567/8929ae32-361f-46ed-8ecc-001230e4a81c.mp4?j=%7B%22userId%22%3A0%2C%22deviceId%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ip%22%3A%22120.244.68.49%2C111.13.186.52%22%7D" type="video/mp4"></video>]]></description><link>https://www.xinpianchang.com/a13638961</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.xinpianchang.com/a13638961</guid><pubDate>Mon, 30 Mar 2026 08:49:50 GMT</pubDate><author>影视干货</author><itunes:image href="https://oss-xpc0.xpccdn.com/uploadfile/article/2026/3/30/f807fd20759056b2ca39e0334b9f64e4"></itunes:image><enclosure url="https://us-xpc5-l2.xpccdn.com/b40309ed-a949-4c73-abc1-c8d25ab87567/8929ae32-361f-46ed-8ecc-001230e4a81c.mp4?j=%7B%22userId%22%3A0%2C%22deviceId%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ip%22%3A%22120.244.68.49%2C111.13.186.52%22%7D" length="79995811" type="video/mp4"></enclosure><itunes:duration>0:07:29</itunes:duration><category>学习分享</category><category>拍摄</category><category>自媒体</category><category>知识分享</category><category>电影质感</category><category>影视干货</category><category>视频创作</category><category>镜头</category></item><item><title>《北极边缘》生计、传统与海洋保护 | BBC</title><description><![CDATA[<p>《北极边缘》（《THE ARCTIC EDGE》）

在格陵兰，不断变暖的海洋正改变着曾经稳定的海冰、鱼类与海洋生物规律。本土知识与保护领域的领导力，正指引着未来的方向。
随着海冰形态变迁、生计受到考验，让我们一同探索社区如何努力保护海洋生态系统，以及与之紧密相连的文化传统。

